Rowland affect data
-------------------
The affect dataset in data/affect.rda is attributed to
Zarah Rowland and Mario Wenzel. It is supplied under Creative Commons
Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International (CC BY-NC 4.0), as reported by
openESM for the Rowland (2020) dataset. This data component is not relicensed
under GPL-3. The data terms do not change the license of the software.

License: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/
Full legal text: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/legalcode
Dataset information: https://openesmdata.org/datasets/0006_rowland/
Original study data: https://osf.io/jmz2n/
Codebook: https://osf.io/5t4yg/

Reference:
Rowland, Z., and Wenzel, M. (2020). Mindfulness and affect-network density:
does mindfulness facilitate disengagement from affective experiences in
daily life? Mindfulness, 11, 1253-1266.
https://doi.org/10.1007/s12671-020-01335-4

Changes from the original study file: retain participant ID and eight emotion
items; remove occasions with all eight items missing; number the remaining
occasions within each participant; keep the first 76; rename the participant
and item columns. The package preserves the resulting user-supplied baseline
data1.dat values without centering, imputation or additional missingness.
See help("affect", package = "pmdplan") for the column mapping.

Reuse of the data requires attribution, identification of changes and
noncommercial use under the linked license. No endorsement by the study
authors or openESM is implied.
